  "body": "https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#legacy-single-byte-encodings\r\n\r\nIn preparing to cut a new copy of encoding for the W3C reference version, I ran validator. The table of singlebyte encodings includes ISO 8859-8-I by itself in the left column of the table, since it shares data with ISO 8859-8. However, the result isn't \"valid\" HTML. The two new columns need rowspan=\"2\" added. Pull request forthcoming.",
